    "files": [
      {
        "path": "docs/programs/reactive-fiber-adaptive-computation-and-control-2026-10-17.md",
        "blob": "929c1651755628b7b1645846ac32141492dbb781",
        "lines": [
          {
            "line": 7,
            "text": "Keep FiberOpticsSDK the authoritative reactive substrate for signal propagation, graph identity, invalidation, deterministic transactions and scheduled work. `src/fiber_optics/fiber.py` already defines lanes `IMMEDIATE`, `AGENT_CRITICAL`, `USER_VISIBLE`, `BACKGROUND`, `SPECULATIVE` and `TRACE_ONLY`, plus bounded feedback/termination. `src/fiber_optics/scheduler.py` already implements deterministic priority dequeue, coalescing, pending `abort_speculative(key)` across all lanes. `src/fiber_optics/events.py` already has `ControlHook`, `ControlDirective.abort_speculative_key` and event sinks. Preserve all of these.",
            "sha256": "a724545f5938880b0b3d9c134ccc1193c202e291548abcb605c6701ea408c9e1"
          },
          {
            "line": 20,
            "text": "`SignalOperator<TIn,TOut>` has `operator_id`, bounded state spec (if stateful), `sample(value, sampleTime, state) -> (value, state, diagnostics)`, deterministic serialization and data-quality behavior. Temporal controller proposal `(controller_id, observed_versions, state_epoch, actuator_id, requested_range, reason, min_interval)` remains data until a host arbiter applies it.",
            "sha256": "3919f8cf576a5b358464215e27b8da782a1ae8f3c34a4f3a9661f1f95706bcb9"
          },
          {
            "line": 22,
            "text": "No direct provider I/O or LLM inference, no global controller auto-registration from import, no controller state mutation during `FiberRuntime.emit` reentrant callbacks. Existing `ControlDirective` is a narrow initial extension seam, not a second controller engine.",
            "sha256": "2e027d70a171ed6268f13a36fbc2feb06d9da4b83dc575bda8ee487f091e253e"
          },
          {
            "line": 40,
            "text": "FO-AC1 temporal operators with golden deterministic outcomes; FO-AC2 versioned event contract/host consumer; FO-AC3 bounded controller emission and proposal arbitration integration in one host; FO-AC4 performance/no-regression and current public API documentation. No effect on default consumer behavior until these gates pass.",
            "sha256": "6532b18d3a205390612b1579310789b36abf7597b765b1eb227103e7023d2b5a"
          }
        ]
      },
